sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant RN as React Native App
  participant API as Medusa API Route
  participant WF as recordCheckIn Workflow
  participant Visit as Visit Module
  participant Tracking as Tracking Module
  participant PG as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
  participant Audit as Audit Module
  RN->>API: POST /api/v1/visits/{id}/check-in
  API->>API: Validate payload, tenant and role
  API->>WF: Invoke with rep, outlet, coordinates
  WF->>Tracking: Verify consent and active work session
  WF->>Visit: Check outlet geofence radius
  Visit->>PG: ST_DWithin outlet point and submitted point
  alt inside geofence
    WF->>Visit: Persist check-in
  else outside or weak GPS
    WF->>Visit: Create geofence exception
  end
  WF->>Audit: Write visit.checked_in or exception event
  WF-->>API: Result
  API-->>RN: Check-in status
